   {
    "ja": "可愛くてごめん"
   },
   {
    "en": "Sorry for Being So Cute"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Based on the song \"Kawaikute Gomen\" by [HoneyWorks](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K4xLi8IF1FM).\n\nIn love with Aizo from the idol unit LIP×LIP, Nakamura Chizuru (Chuutan) is a doutankyohi otaku who refuses to share her oshi with anyone else! She gives gifts, goes to events, and happily supports Aizo and Aizo only with  her heart and soul! Working part time at a maid café to earn money to support her oshi, the cute and cunning \"Chuutan\" is popular and goes on to live a fulfilling life... Suddenly, a maid who is jealous of her appears?!",
   "ja": "アイドルユニット『LIP×LIP』の愛蔵が大好きな高校１年の中村千鶴（ちゅーたん）は同担拒否なオタク。１人でも贈り物をしたり、イベントに行ったり、全身全霊で愛蔵を推す毎日は超幸せ！推し活資金を稼ぐためのメイド喫茶のバイトでも、可愛くて気の利く“ちゅーたん”は大人気で充実した日々を送っていたけど…。そんな彼女を妬むメイドが現れて!?"
  },
